abstract: >-
  An inspectable governance prototype for a four-agent LangGraph pipeline with four MCP servers,
  combining a learned trajectory classifier, deterministic rules, decision precedence, enforced
  provenance, scored handoffs, a human-approval gate and a hash-chained audit log. Includes the
  exploratory Phase 1 evaluation and a pre-registered Phase 2 evaluation with canary-token ground
  truth, its raw results, analysis code and an independent recomputation. Code under MIT; data,
  results and text under CC BY 4.0.
